It would seem too me that once armor has been thoroughly rotted or
rusted, successive rotting/rusting attacks should reduce the
enchantment on the eq by one and if the enchantment is reduced to
zero, the blessed flag should be removed, and if it goes negative it
should become cursed.

I think it would make a LOT of sense, and provide a better reason for
foo'proofing your armor if you get stuck with thoroughly rotted cursed
-2 gloves (which btw, should not protect against handling footrice
corpses, likewise thoroughly rusty boots for kicking them).



